graph TD
    subgraph 知识图谱_先修关系DAG
        A[基础知识] --> B[进阶概念]
        A --> C[核心概念]
        B --> D[综合应用]
        C --> D
        D --> E[拓展提升]
    end
    
    subgraph 拓扑排序算法
        T1[入度为0的节点入队] --> T2[出队并标记已学习]
        T2 --> T3[后继节点入度减1]
        T3 --> T4{入度等于零}
        T4 -->|是| T1
        T4 -->|否| T5[输出学习路径]
    end
    
    subgraph 个性化学习路径
        S1[第1步 基础知识] --> S2[第2步 进阶概念]
        S2 --> S3[第3步 核心知识]
        S3 --> S4[第4步 综合应用]
        S4 --> S5[第5步 拓展提升]
    end
    
    style A fill:#86efac,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#86efac,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    style S1 fill:#86efac,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    style S3 fill:#86efac,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    style S2 fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:2px
    style S4 fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:2px
    style S5 fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:2px
